{"id":"4739","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4739_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-cirru-spissatus-and-stratocumulus-cumulogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张图像中主要是一层薄薄的几乎白色的层状透光漏光高积云。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波浪形状</span>（波状云类）正在这层云的东部边缘形成。</p>\n<p>下部是一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>细胞；其中一个正在下<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阵雨</span>。也存在由低层风<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">切变</span>的中积云细胞。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云的云片</span>是是积云顶部的残余物，它们在稳定的层（积云性）下扩散。更多的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云性层积云</span>正在几个地区形成。</p>\n<p>最后，几块<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>位于高积云以东。没有任何迹象表明这些厚厚的卷云是积雨云上层的残余物。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Phoebe Dill","location":"百慕大圣乔治","latitude":"纬度: 32° 21' 50'' N","longitude":"经度: 64° 39' 6'' W","date":"10 September 2015 1301 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 4, CM= 3, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.7"},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4739_upper_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-cirru-spissatus-and-stratocumulus-cumulogenitus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"></div>","copyright":"© University of Wyoming","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5172_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这层中云是高积云。其<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆形云团和卷轴</span>视宽为1°-5°，有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴影</span>。该高积云的具体云种可列为层状云，因为云的天空覆盖范围大。云片很透光，可显露出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">太阳的位置</span>，因此它也是透光云类。在某些地方，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云素之间有空隙</span>，这也表明是漏隙云类，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">长且大致平行的卷轴</span>表明也适用波状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 36'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 49' 26'' W","date":"31 August 2014 0850 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7"}]}]}